					"nextDialogs": [
						721780404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721780404,
					"content": "（这座神龛朴素却优雅，木造的龛体微微闪烁着流光，以端庄的沉默迎接来客的供奉。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721780405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "神龛"
				},
				{
					"id": 721780405,
					"content": "（神龛旁边散落着许多神樱花瓣，看起来不像是自然所成，却像是有人特意在这里洒下了绯樱绣球。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721780406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "神龛"
				},
				{
					"id": 721780406,
					"content": "唔…这里也没有痕迹呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721780407,
						721780408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721780407,
					"content": "看，绯樱绣球…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721780409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721780409,
					"content": "对哦，长次提到过他妈妈会在神龛供奉这个的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721780410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721780410,
					"content": "这么多花瓣出现在这里…应该不会是偶然。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721780411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721780411,
					"content": "我们快回去告诉他吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721780408,
